Chapter B: Spanning sets
B.1: Unrestricted sumsets:
φ(G, h ) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, hA = G}
φ(G, [0, s ]) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, [0, s ]A = G}
φ(G, N0) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, ⟨A⟩ = G}
B.2: Unrestricted signed sumsets:
φ ± (G, h ) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, h ± A = G}
φ ± (G, [0, s ]) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, [0, s ]± A = G}
φ ± (G, N0) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, ⟨A⟩ = G}

B.3: Restricted sumsets:
φˆ (G, h ) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, h ˆA = G}
φˆ (G, [0, s ]) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, [0, s ] ˆA = G}
φˆ (G, N0) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, ΣA = G}
B.4: Restricted signed sumsets:
φ ˆ± (G, h ) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, h ˆ± A = G}
φ ˆ± (G, [0, s ]) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, [0, s ]ˆ± A = G}
φ ˆ± (G, N0) = min {|A| |A ⊆ G, Σ± A = G}
